      "text": "The dominant form factor for cold-climate heat pumps and zone additions:"
    },
    {
      "id": "05-HEAT-PUMPS.md#028",
      "path": [
        "05-HEAT-PUMPS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:hvac:05-heat-pumps, git-history:hvac:05-heat-pumps]",
        "canonical_path": "hvac/05-HEAT-PUMPS.md",
        "concepts": "[heat, pumps]",
        "current_path": "hvac/05-HEAT-PUMPS.md",
        "id": "maxim:hvac:heat-pumps",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "hvac",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[heat, pumps]",
        "section": "hvac",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Heat Pumps",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  MINI-SPLIT ARCHITECTURE:\n  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │                                                                   │\n  │  OUTDOOR UNIT (\"condenser\")                                       │\n  │  ┌──────────────────────┐                                         │\n  │  │ Compressor (inverter)│                                         │\n  │  │ Outdoor coil         │                                         │\n  │  │ Fan                  │                                         │\n  │  └──────────┬───────────┘                                         │\n  │             │ Refrigerant line set (3/8\" liquid + 5/8\" suction)   │\n  │             │ + control wire + power                              │\n  │             │ Max line length: ~100 ft (model-dependent)          │\n  │             │                                                     │\n  │         ┌───┴────┐                                                │\n  │         │ Indoor │  Wall-mounted cassette (most common)           │\n  │         │ unit 1 │  OR ceiling cassette, floor console,           │\n  │         │ (\"air  │     concealed ducted air handler               │\n  │         │ handler│  Each indoor unit = independent zone           │\n  │         └────────┘  with its own remote/app control               │\n  │         │                                                         │\n  │         ┌───┴────┐                                                │\n  │         │ Indoor │  Multi-zone: one outdoor, multiple indoors     │\n  │         │ unit 2 │  (capacity shared — each indoor sized          │\n  │         └────────┘   appropriately)                              │\n  │                                                                   │\n  └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
